l  or tracker to take full advantage but to  make things complex again what  unsilenced means is more than one thing  for example the m1928 that i used a  bunch of this beta could take subsonic  rounds that keep you off the minimap  when you shoot it could also take a  suppressor which oddly enough didn't say  that it did the same thing so more  testing will be needed to see how you  actually stay off the minimap when  firing when it comes to kill streaks i  probably won't say much about them at  this point death machine was kind of  cool because it persisted between lives  but honestly there wasn't much to write  home about here versus being able to  drop an entire tank on some maps with a  kill streak in modern warfare modern  warfare also let players toggle between  kill streaks and score streaks which was  kind of cool i guess one random thing to  add here because i didn't have another  category to put it in is that vanguard  has teased a field of view slider coming  to console at launch it's been really  hard to go back from cold war to modern  warfare after having had that wider  field of view so if that's in the final  build of vanguard that will be a  technical leg up on modern warfare  there's a lot more to talk about with  vanguard we're getting an entirely new  warzone map and it's about time i'm  really hoping they take this chance for  a do-over from warzone because you can't  just keep adding 30 guns with every  release and expect a balanced meta  that's an impossible task so i want to  hear from you at this point does  vanguard appeal to you if you're a  modern warfare fan or if you're  following the latest news it now looks  like vanguard and battlefield 2042 will  release within two weeks of each other  so are you just gonna jump ship to  battlefield let me know in the comments  below thanks for watching  you

